 # Research log
 
+## Retained photo copying (#237) — 2026-10-12
+
+Checked [Expo SDK57](https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v57.0.0/), [FileSystem downloadFileAsync](https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v57.0.0/sdk/filesystem/#downloadfileasyncurl-destination-options) and [Supabase private signed access](https://supabase.com/docs/reference/javascript/storage-from-createsignedurl). Download the existing owner-authorized private thumbnail into a unique owner-local file before creating nutrition; await download, check nonempty/256KiB bounds, and clean partial/late results on either platform. Copy uses the existing validated JPEG upload and target-specific durable retry; it does not share a source asset or persist a signed URL. Fence photo read/upload and nutrition dispatch with expectedUserId plus the caller's current owner/token scope. An attachment failure after nutrition creation remains a saved meal with a photo retry, never a second meal POST. Persist Home photo intent and staging under its immutable nutrition operation before dispatch so a remount or lost nutrition response reuses original bytes and does not depend on the source still existing. Transfer only staging metadata after the target retry is durable. Existing Dev-only/Pro API checks and account-erasure guards remain. No new backend endpoint, schema, native dependency or provider call.
+
 ## Android adaptive windows and edge-to-edge (#235) — 2026-10-11
 
 Checked [Android16 orientation/resizability](https://developer.android.com/develop/adaptive-apps/guides/app-orientation-aspect-ratio-resizability), [Android edge-to-edge/insets](https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/layout/edge-to-edge), [Expo supported mods](https://docs.expo.dev/config-plugins/mods/), [Material1.14.0 release](https://github.com/material-components/material-components-android/releases/tag/1.14.0) and [Gradle dependency constraints](https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/dependency_constraints.html). Remove only Android MainActivity's generated portrait restriction and enable resizing; preserve the shared/iOS portrait setting. Retain edgeToEdgeEnabled=true consumed by RN's generated application entrypoint. Upgrade the app's resolved Material dependency from1.13.0 to1.14.0 with a scoped strict constraint: upstream dialog helpers guard legacy bar setters below API35, and minSdk23/AGP8.11.1 prerequisites fit installed minSdk24/AGP8.12.0. RN0.86.3 still packages flag-false cutout compatibility branches; no broad vendor patch or R8 removal assumption. Exact deprecated-reference absence and Play clearance are not established by modern runtime paths. Exercise an actual optimized Dev APK, inspect resolved dependency/manifest/DEX, and test adaptive layouts. Only installed API36 image is available; older-version/device/Store acceptance remains qualified. No Production artifacts, version bump, backend or upload.
